> I grew up with[ stove] top mac and cheese.[ Luckily] my mother often made her own from scratch, but I also had the commercial boxed mac and cheese as well. Personally I’[ve] always prefered stove top to baked. I know, it is controversial. There is something to that vel[vety] sauce and soft texture. It is simple and[ concise].
